OL,3,GNEWSAPulp top the bill at 20th End of
OL,4,Athe Road Festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sell-out crowd of 15,000 helped
OL,7,Fcelebrate the End Of The Road
OL,8,FFestival's 20th birthday this weekend,
OL,9,Fin one of the final events of the UK
OL,10,Fsummer season.
OL,12,FBritpop luminaries Pulp closed the
OL,13,Fmainstage on Saturday night at the
OL,14,Ffour-day event, near Blandford Forum,
OL,15,FDorset.
OL,17,FThe event's anniversary line-up also
OL,18,Fincluded Irish indie-pop singer Cmat,
OL,19,FNew York art-rockers Geese and Canadian
OL,20,Fsinger-songwriter Mac DeMarco.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
